            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Omwoyo wa Ruhanga yaija ahari Zekaria mwene Yehoyaada omunyamurwa, yaayemerera eruguru y'abantu, yaabagira ati: Ahabw'enki mugomeire ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, kikabareetera kutaba gye? Mutsigireho MUKAMA, nawe nikyo abatsigiireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
