        },
        {
          "text": " Abasiria ku baamurugireho, baatsiga ahutaire munonga, abaheereza be baamugirira enaama nibahoorera eshagama ya mwene Yehoyaada omunyamurwa, baamwitira aha kitanda kye. Atyo yaafa, baamuziika omu rurembo rwa Daudi; kwonka tibaamuziika mu bituuro by'abagabe.",
          "type": "text",
